hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"221","[AI-translation] ((Bibi Umm Atiyyah (Allah amridhie) amesimulia: Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alituamrisha tuwatoe mabinti wadogo, mabinti waliojifunika, na wanawake wenye hedhi siku za Idi al-Fitri na Idi al-Adh-ha kwenda kiwanja cha Idi. Ama wanawake wenye hedhi, wakae mbali na mahali pa swala na washuhudie kheri na dua za Waislamu.))"
"222","[AI-translation] ((Hisham ameipokea kwa isnad hii mfano wake.))"
"223","[AI-translation] ((Bibi Umm Atiyyah (Allah amridhie) amesimulia: Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alituamrisha tuwatoe katika Idi mbili mabinti waliojisitiri na wanawake wenye hedhi (kwenda kiwanja cha Idi), washuhudie pamoja na Waislamu dua yao na swala yao, na wanawake wenye hedhi wajiepushe na swala.))"
"224","[AI-translation] ((Bibi Umm Atiyyah (Allah amridhie) amesimulia: Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alituamrisha tuwatoe katika Idi mbili mabinti wadogo, wanawake wenye hedhi na mabinti waliojifunika. Ama wenye hedhi, watakuwa karibu na kiwanja cha Idi wakishuhudia dua za Waislamu.))"
"225","[AI-translation] ((Bibi Umm Atiyyah (Allah amridhie) amesimulia: Nilisema: Ewe Mtume wa Allah, mmoja wetu hana jilbabu? Akasema (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam): ""Dada yake na amvikeshe sehemu ya jilbabu lake."" Abu Ya'qub amesema: Yaani katika kutoka Idi mbili.))"
"226","[AI-translation] ((Hisham ameipokea kwa isnad hii mfano wa hadithi iliyotangulia.))"
"227","[AI-translation] ((Dada wa Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Rawaha (Umra bint Rawaha, Allah amridhie) amesimulia kutoka kwa Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam), amesema: ""Inawajibikia kila mwanamke anayefunga ukanda kwenda (kiwanja cha Idi) katika Idi mbili.""))"
"228","[AI-translation] ((Sayyiduna Ibn Abbas (Allah awaridhie wote wawili) amesimulia kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) aliswalisha swala za Idi, kisha akahutubu. Sayyiduna Abu Bakr (Allah amridhie) pia aliswalisha vivyo hivyo kisha akahutubu. Sayyiduna Umar (Allah amridhie) pia aliswalisha vivyo hivyo, kisha akahutubu, na Sayyiduna Uthman (Allah amridhie) pia aliswalisha vivyo hivyo, kisha akahutubu. Hakukuwa na Adhana wala Iqama humo. Mu'ammal amesimulia: Tutasema kwamba Masahaba hawa wote waliswalisha swala za Idi bila Adhana wala Iqama.))"
"229","[AI-translation] ((Imesimuliwa kutoka kwa Amr bin Dinar kwamba alimsikia Sayyiduna Ibn Abbas (Allah awaridhie wote wawili) akisoma takbira (Allahu Akbar, Allahu Akbar) siku za Idi. Amr (bin Dinar) amesema: Sijui kati ya mambo mawili alikusudia lipi: Kauli ya Allah Mtukufu: ""Mnapomaliza ibada za Hijja, basi mkumbukeni Allah."" Au kauli Yake: ""Na mkumbukeni Allah katika siku maalumu zenye kuhesabika.""))"
"230","[AI-translation] ((Sayyiduna Ibn Abbas (Allah awaridhie wote wawili) anasimulia kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alitoka (kwenda kiwanja cha Idi) siku ya Idi, kisha akaswalisha, kisha akahutubu, na akadhania kwamba wanawake hawakusikia. Basi baada ya tatu (siku), aliwaendea, akawaonya na kuwanasihi, na akawahimiza kutoa sadaka. Basi wanawake wakaanza kuvua hereni zao na pete na kuzitupa, na Sayyiduna Bilal (Allah amridhie) akaanza kuzikusanya katika nguo yake.))"
